              <i class="fa-solid fa-download me-1"></i> Agent binaries served by this Directory
            </div>
            <div class="card-body py-3">
              <p class="small text-muted mb-3">
                Direct downloads of the artifacts this Directory stages for agent installs
                (<code>/resources/theta-agent/</code>). Handy for offline or air-gapped hosts,
                or to inspect an installer before running it. The Windows setup exe and the
                checksums are staged by <code>setup.sh</code> from the pinned theta-agent release.
              </p>
